scene zz_verify_screenplay
  $: INT. VERIFY ROOM - NIGHT

  ZADIE:
    [[zadie]]
    A line of dialogue for the screenplay check.

  choose
    Which way?
    * [Go left.]
      -> zz_verify_left
    * [Go right.]
      -> zz_verify_left
  end

  branch zz_verify_left
    Imani waits by the door.
    queue | One short arm. | Another short arm. end
    queue
      | The first long arm.
      | The second long arm.
    end
    if told_rosa then
      Rosa waves.
    else
      Nobody waves.
    end
    ^: THE CENTRED LINE
  end
end
